.TH PRODBOX_internal_kind_family_controller 1
.SH NAME
prodbox-internal-kind-family-controller \- Run the pinned kind operation-family controller
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B prodbox internal-kind-family-controller
.SH DESCRIPTION
Internal controller requiring pinned inputs and an observed operation parent. Arguments do not grant lifecycle admission.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB--config\fR <PATH>
Exact pinned import-free controller settings file
.TP
\fB--request\fR <PATH>
Exact pinned original controller request file
.TP
\fB--input-fingerprint\fR <SHA256>
Published executable/settings/request fingerprint
.TP
\fB--operation-key\fR <SHA256>
Original operation execution key
.TP
\fB--outer-ns\fR <NANOSECONDS>
Original monotonic outer deadline
.TP
\fB--work-ns\fR <NANOSECONDS>
Original monotonic work deadline
.TP
\fB--hard-ns\fR <NANOSECONDS>
Original monotonic hard deadline
.TP
\fB--stop-ns\fR <NANOSECONDS>
Original monotonic stop deadline
.TP
\fB--finish-ns\fR <NANOSECONDS>
Original monotonic finish deadline
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
\fBprodbox internal-kind-family-controller --config /run/prodbox/controller/settings.dhall --request /run/prodbox/controller/request.json --input-fingerprint aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa --operation-key bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb --outer-ns 50000000000 --work-ns 40000000000 --hard-ns 42000000000 --stop-ns 45000000000 --finish-ns 47000000000\fR
Closed envelope supplied by the operation publisher
